<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

    <title>15th Down Scouting Ireland</title>

    <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
</head>

<body>

<header>
    <div class="logo">
        🌲 15th Down Scouting Ireland
    </div>

    <nav>
        <a href="#home">Home</a>
        <a href="#about">About Our Scouts</a>
        <a href="#activities">Activities</a>
        <a href="#contact">Contact Us</a>
    </nav>
</header>


<section id="home" class="hero">

    <div class="hero-content">

        <h1>15th Down Scouting Ireland</h1>

        <p>
            Adventure • Friendship • Skills • Community
        </p>

        <a href="#activities" class="button">
            Explore Our Activities
        </a>

    </div>

</section>


<section id="about" class="section">

    <h2>About Our Scouts</h2>

    <p>
        Welcome to 15th Down Scouting Ireland.
        We are a friendly scouting group where young people
        can learn new skills, explore the outdoors and make
        memories with friends.
    </p>

    <p>
        Scouting is all about adventure, teamwork, confidence
        and helping others. Our scouts take part in activities
        that challenge them while having plenty of fun.
    </p>

</section>


<section id="activities" class="section activities-section">

    <h2>Our Activities</h2>

    <div class="activities">

        <div class="card">
            <div class="icon">⛺</div>
            <h3>Camping</h3>
            <p>
                Learn camping skills, cook outdoors and enjoy
                exciting nights under the stars.
            </p>
        </div>


        <div class="card">
            <div class="icon">🥾</div>
            <h3>Hiking & Exploring</h3>
            <p>
                Explore the countryside, follow trails and
                discover new places.
            </p>
        </div>


        <div class="card">
            <div class="icon">🧭</div>
            <h3>Navigation</h3>
            <p>
                Learn map reading, compass skills and how to
                find your way on an adventure.
            </p>
        </div>


        <div class="card">
            <div class="icon">🔥</div>
            <h3>Campcraft</h3>
            <p>
                Learn practical outdoor skills including
                fires, shelters and cooking.
            </p>
        </div>


        <div class="card">
            <div class="icon">🤝</div>
            <h3>Teamwork</h3>
            <p>
                Work together, solve challenges and build
                confidence with your fellow scouts.
            </p>
        </div>


        <div class="card">
            <div class="icon">🌳</div>
            <h3>Community & Nature</h3>
            <p>
                Get involved in the community and learn how
                to look after the environment.
            </p>
        </div>

    </div>

</section>


<section class="quote">

    <h2>“Adventure starts where the comfort zone ends.”</h2>

    <p>
        Learn skills. Make friends. Have adventures.
    </p>

</section>


<section id="contact" class="section contact">

    <h2>Contact Us</h2>

    <p>
        Want to find out more about 15th Down Scouting Ireland?
        Get in touch with us.
    </p>


    <form id="contactForm">

        <input
            type="text"
            id="name"
            placeholder="Your Name"
            required
        >

        <input
            type="email"
            id="email"
            placeholder="Your Email"
            required
        >

        <textarea
            id="message"
            placeholder="Your Message"
            rows="6"
            required
        ></textarea>

        <button type="submit">
            Send Message
        </button>

    </form>

    <p id="formMessage"></p>

</section>


<footer>

    <p>
        © 2026 15th Down Scouting Ireland
    </p>

    <p>
        Adventure • Friendship • Skills • Community
    </p>

</footer>


<script src="script.js"></script>

</body>
</html>
